  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the sous-vide machine to 160F (71C).",
    "In a bowl, combine the natural yoghurt, egg, lemon juice, ground cumin, and crushed red pepper. ",
    "Mix until well combined.",
    "Add the toasted bread, chopped onion, chopped parsley, chopped mint, pumpkin seeds, and salt to the yoghurt mixture.",
    "Mix until well combined.",
    "Place the mixture in a sous-vide bag and seal.",
    "Cook in the sous-vide machine for 1 hour.",
    "Remove the bag from the sous-vide machine and let it sit in an ice bath for 10 minutes.",
    "Open the bag and mix the muhammara well.",
    "Serve chilled."
  ],
